tation, the unit round metric and the alpha-plane distribution; its horizontal curvature equation detects exactly $F_A^+=0$. [[def-qftx-coupled-penrose-incidence-geometry]], [[lem-qftx-coupled-penrose-positive-orientation-asd]]
+
+[F2] Fibrewise harmonic projection defines a well-defined injective map from the analytic cohomology group to $\Gamma(S^4,E)$, conditional on the comparison in [A1]. [[lem-qftx-coupled-penrose-injective-edge]]
+
