@@ -0,0 +1,102 @@
+---
+id: thm-qftx-coupled-penrose-vanishing
+kind: theorem
+title: Coupled Penrose vanishing on the round four-sphere
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+domain: mathematics
+library: mathematics
+category: quantum-field-theory-mathematics
+page: qftx-coupled-penrose-vanishing-on-the-round-four-sphere
